.TH "AG\-CLI\-PR\-EDIT" "1" "2026\-10\-09" "AtomGit CLI 0.7.4" "AtomGit CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
\&ag\-cli\-pr\-edit \- Edit a pull request
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\&ag\-cli pr edit [<owner>/<repo>] <number> [flags]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
\&Edit a pull request and explicitly add or remove collaboration metadata.
.PP
\&Assignees, approval reviewers, and testers are distinct AtomGit roles.
\&Unspecified metadata is left unchanged; use \-\-milestone none to clear the
\&current milestone.
.PP
\&When OWNER/REPO is omitted, the repository is inferred from the current Git repository. An explicit OWNER/REPO argument always takes precedence. Remote selection prefers remote.pushDefault, the current branch upstream, origin, then a unique AtomGit/GitCode remote.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-add\-assignee <stringSlice>\fR
\&Assignee login to add (repeat for multiple users)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-add\-label <stringSlice>\fR
\&Label name to add (repeat for multiple labels)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-add\-reviewer <stringSlice>\fR
\&Approval reviewer login to add (repeat for multiple users)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-add\-tester <stringSlice>\fR
\&Tester login to add (repeat for multiple users)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-b, \-\-body <string>\fR
\&New PR body
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-F, \-\-body\-file <string>\fR
\&Read new PR body from file (use \- for stdin)
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-milestone <string>\fR
\&Milestone number, exact title, or 'none' to clear
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-remove\-assignee <stringSlice>\fR
\&Assignee login to remove (repeat for multiple users)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-remove\-label <stringSlice>\fR
\&Label name to remove (repeat for multiple labels)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-remove\-reviewer <stringSlice>\fR
\&Approval reviewer login to remove (repeat for multiple users)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-remove\-tester <stringSlice>\fR
\&Tester login to remove (repeat for multiple users)
\&Default: \(dq[]\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-t, \-\-title <string>\fR
\&New PR title
\&Default: \(dq\(dq.
.SH INHERITED OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
\&Show help for command
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.TP
\fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
\&Disable terminal output sanitization for machine processing
\&Default: \(dqfalse\(dq.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
\&ag\-cli pr edit owner/repo 123 \-\-title \(dqUpdated title\(dq
\&  ag\-cli pr edit owner/repo 123 \-\-body \(dqUpdated description\(dq
\&  ag\-cli pr edit owner/repo 123 \-\-body\-file description.md
\&  ag\-cli pr edit owner/repo 123 \-\-body\-file \-
.fi
